    "detailed_description": "In this new adventure RPG, you will be playing as Diesel. Trouble in the Kingdom of Everlyn has called the King to ask Diesel and his best friend Fred to join the army to fight off the evil Luna. Help Diesel fight off Luna and her forces and become the best warrior in all of Everlyn!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264470/extras/a66c61d83ce3fda18b0c1d37c3321720.poster.avif?t=1720638759\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264470/extras/a66c61d83ce3fda18b0c1d37c3321720.webm?t=1720638759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264470/extras/a66c61d83ce3fda18b0c1d37c3321720.mp4?t=1720638759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>This game is designed to be an adventure RPG packed with story and comedy. This game also contains lots of easter eggs!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264470/extras/19e9fd0e195772f3d54f50b5284d6fe6.poster.avif?t=1720638759\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264470/extras/19e9fd0e195772f3d54f50b5284d6fe6.webm?t=1720638759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264470/extras/19e9fd0e195772f3d54f50b5284d6fe6.mp4?t=1720638759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fight all types of enemies and use different items to shape your Pug Warrior Adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264470/extras/13e115a78ea80ba9e7e902bafd8243dd.poster.avif?t=1720638759\" ><sourc